## 2. ⚙️ Architecture Flow

```
[ Selenium Scrapers ]
        ↓
  ┌──────────────────────┐
  │   staging_jobs (raw) │
  └──────────────────────┘
        ↓
       ETL
        ↓
  ┌──────────────┬────────────────────┐
  │ vault_jobs    │ portal_jobs        │
  │ (sensitive)   │ (anonymised data)  │
  └──────────────┴────────────────────┘
        ↓
  [ skill_master + summary + API ]
```

