## 4. 🧠 ETL Process Summary

**Script:** `/etl/etl_jobs.py`

Responsibilities:

* Reads unprocessed `staging_jobs`
* Cleans & anonymises job text
* Derives `required_skills`, `preferred_skills`, and `salary_band`
* Inserts into `vault_jobs` (sensitive) and `portal_jobs` (anonymised)
* Auto-learns new skills into `skill_master`
* Updates daily summary

ETL is modular and transaction-safe — every error is logged and rolled back without interrupting subsequent jobs.

