## 10. ✅ Maintenance & CI/CD Hooks

* Schedule daily ETL via cron inside the ETL container:

  ```bash
  docker exec jobportal_etl bash -c "python /app/etl/etl_jobs.py"
  ```
* Log output to `/var/log/etl_jobs.log` (volume-mounted)
* Run tests before deploy:

  ```bash
  docker-compose exec api pytest
  ```
* Optional GitHub Actions workflow can auto-rebuild containers if any ETL or API changes are pushed.

